{"id":"3e426ba53e1b66a0","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-quine-construction.md","title":"Quine Construction","display":"df-quine-construction — Quine Construction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-quine-construction","aliases":["90-df-quine-construction"],"display":"df-quine-construction — Quine Construction","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursion-theorem]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[90-thm-smn]]","[[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]","[[90-df-halt-notation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-quine-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-quine-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quine-construction — Quine Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40d9084cba778b26\" href=\"?note=40d9084cba778b26\" title=\"90-df-recursion-theorem\">90-df-recursion-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5cdab62986807336\" href=\"?note=5cdab62986807336\" title=\"90-thm-smn\">90-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b8b8df152b92c5d9\" href=\"?note=b8b8df152b92c5d9\" title=\"90-thm-recursion-theorem\">90-thm-recursion-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"725681f54d4cc140\" href=\"?note=725681f54d4cc140\" title=\"90-df-halt-notation\">90-df-halt-notation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定编号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 及部分函数等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>要求 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span>；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi_{c(e)}(x)\\downarrow=e\">\\(\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi_{c(e)}(x)\\downarrow=e\\)</span> 的常量程序编译器；下降等号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"725681f54d4cc140\" href=\"?note=725681f54d4cc140\" title=\"90-df-halt-notation\">90-df-halt-notation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quine}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quine}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Quine}(e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi_e(0)\\downarrow=e,\\\\\n[\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\land c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\n\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi_{c(e)}(x)\\downarrow=e]\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{c(e)}\\land\\mathrm{Quine}(e)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Quine}(e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi_e(0)\\downarrow=e,\\\\\n[\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\land c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\n\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi_{c(e)}(x)\\downarrow=e]\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{c(e)}\\land\\mathrm{Quine}(e)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>二元投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,x)\\mapsto e\">\\((e,x)\\mapsto e\\)</span> 有一个程序索引；由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"5cdab62986807336\" href=\"?note=5cdab62986807336\" title=\"90-thm-smn\">90-thm-smn</a> 固化第一参数，得到上述全递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b8b8df152b92c5d9\" href=\"?note=b8b8df152b92c5d9\" title=\"90-thm-recursion-theorem\">90-thm-recursion-theorem</a>，所得固定点程序在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 上输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持“输出自己的程序索引”的原接口，不把它改成输出具体源代码文本。程序索引不必等于编译器输出的索引。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"40d9084cba778b26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"1802adc1900d4b34","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"5cdab62986807336","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"b8b8df152b92c5d9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-halt-notation","status":"resolved","id":"725681f54d4cc140","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-halt-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定编号族 $\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}$、$\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}$ 及部分函数等号 $\\simeq$ 见 [[90-df-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"1802adc1900d4b34","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"要求 [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"要求 [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"要求 [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-halt-notation","status":"resolved","id":"725681f54d4cc140","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 是满足 $\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi_{c(e)}(x)\\downarrow=e$ 的常量程序编译器；下降等号见 [[90-df-halt-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"5cdab62986807336","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Proof]","excerpt":"二元投影 $(e,x)\\mapsto e$ 有一个程序索引；由 [[90-thm-smn]] 固化第一参数，得到上述全递归 $c$。对 $c$ 应用 [[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]，所得固定点程序在输入 $0$ 上输出 $e$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"b8b8df152b92c5d9","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Proof]","excerpt":"二元投影 $(e,x)\\mapsto e$ 有一个程序索引；由 [[90-thm-smn]] 固化第一参数，得到上述全递归 $c$。对 $c$ 应用 [[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]，所得固定点程序在输入 $0$ 上输出 $e$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi_{c(e)}(x)\\downarrow=e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Quine}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Quine}(e)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi_e(0)\\downarrow=e,\\\\\n[\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\land c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\n\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi_{c(e)}(x)\\downarrow=e]\n&\\Longrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{c(e)}\\land\\mathrm{Quine}(e)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(e,x)\\mapsto e","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false}],"bytes":2037,"backlinks":[{"id":"486f013af515d400","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"用 [[90-df-quine-construction]] 中的常量程序编译器及固定点构造，立即得到断言。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-add